  "name": "UsageReport",
  "description": "Sub-workflow tool for the Test Suites MCP server. Reads Slack history with the Darwin bot token and reports distinct users who interact with Darwin, month by month. Linear pipeline: list conversations, find Darwin threads, fetch replies, aggregate. Exclud",
